---
import Arrow from './Arrow.astro';

const facts = [
  { label: 'EDUCATION', value: 'Information Systems, Universitas Dian Nuswantoro' },
  { label: 'FOCUS', value: 'Backend · Web applications · Practical AI' },
];
---

<section class="about section container" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-title">
  <div class="about-intro">
    <span class="eyebrow">02 / THE THINKING BEHIND IT</span>
    <h2 id="about-title">The right fit<br>starts with <em>context.</em></h2>
    <p>I'm Arik. I enjoy working out why something is difficult, and what would make it easier. My background in software helps me turn that understanding into something people can use.</p>
    <p>Analysis, engineering, and AI are parts of that work. The goal is a solution that fits the people, the constraints, and the way things actually run.</p>
    <dl class="about-facts">
      {facts.map((fact) => <div><dt>{fact.label}</dt><dd>{fact.value}</dd></div>)}
    </dl>
    <a class="text-link" href="#contact">Say hello <Arrow /></a>
  </div>
  <figure class="about-photo">
    <div class="about-frame"><img src="/images/arik-photo.webp" alt="Portrait of Muhammad Ariyanto (Arik), wearing a navy shirt and a university lanyard" width="1133" height="1700" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div>
    <figcaption><span>MUHAMMAD ARIYANTO</span><span>ARIK</span></figcaption>
  </figure>
</section>
